# meld-rs
===
 Meld-rs is a complete rewrite of the Meld visual diff and merge tool in Rust using gtk-rs (GTK 4). It provides side-by-side file and directory comparison, 3-way merge, and version control integration (Git, SVN, Mercurial)..
